# Cloudflare's build clones this repo and publishes the whole folder as
# static assets, so anything not listed here goes live at oliverbarwell.com/<path>.
# Only index.html (and anything under assets/) is meant to be public.

# Dotfiles and dot-folders: .git (full history), .wrangler, .claude, .DS_Store
.*

# Config the build generates or that only matters to GitHub Pages
wrangler.jsonc
wrangler.toml
CNAME
node_modules/

# Working docs and scripts
*.md
*.py
